WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.800
The door plug separation, the grounding order and the probable-cause finding came at different points in the Flight 1282 record.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.440
5 Jan 2024. A door plug separates and the flight returns to Portland.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:24.000
6 Jan 2024. The FAA grounds certain Boeing 737-9 MAX airplanes.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.760
24 Jun 2025. The NTSB determines the probable cause.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:35.200
The full chronology links to the NTSB investigation and the FAA’s actions.
